msgid ""
"Your QWeather API key. Create a project with Web API credentials at dev."
"qweather.com to get one"
msgstr ""
"你的和风天气 API 密钥。在 dev.qweather.com 创建一个 Web API 项目即可获取"

msgid "API Host"
msgstr "API 主机"

msgid ""
"Your dedicated API Host from the QWeather console (Settings page), e.g. "
"abc123xyz.def.qweatherapi.com. Required for city search; other requests fall "
"back to api.qweather.com when left empty"
msgstr ""
"你在和风天气控制台「设置」页获取的专属 API 主机，例如 abc123xyz.def."
"qweatherapi.com。城市搜索必填；留空时其他请求回退到 api.qweather.com"

msgid "Location"
msgstr "位置"

msgid ""
"A city name (e.g. Beijing or 上海), a QWeather Location ID (e.g. 101010100) "
"or coordinates as longitude,latitude (e.g. 116.41,39.92)"
msgstr ""
"城市名（如 Beijing 或 上海）、和风 Location ID（如 101010100）或经度,纬度坐标"
"（如 116.41,39.92）"

